{
  "description": "Every display plot type gEAR knows about, shared by the Python backend (lib/gear/plot_types.py) and the browser. Keys are the canonical plot_type values stored in dataset_display. family: plotly | scanpy | mg_plotly | mg_scanpy | svg | gosling | spatial (mg_* families are multigene). aliases: legacy or curator-only names that mean the same plot type. full_width: give the display a full-width tile in auto-arranged layouts. basis: embedding used by scanpy-family plots (tsne | umap | pca).",
  "plot_types": {
    "bar": {"label": "Bar", "family": "plotly"},
    "line": {"label": "Line", "family": "plotly"},
